She seemed fine!

26
00:03:45,840 --> 00:03:46,680
I'm sorry.

27
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:50,857
The truth is, ever since January,
when you first came to visit her,

28
00:03:50,940 --> 00:03:52,477
her condition's been touch and go.

29
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,820
and for these last three months.

30
00:03:55,140 --> 00:03:58,677
We've all been stunned by how
Yuki's managed to hang in there.

31
00:03:58,760 --> 00:04:01,500
She can't beat this,
but she keeps fighting.

32
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,680
She keeps on fighting.

33
